      "grammar": "verb, first conjugation",
      "evidence": [
        "Cic. Tusc. 2.56 (Lewis &amp; Short): <span lang=\"la\">in stadiō cursōrēs exclāmant quam maximē possunt</span>"
      ],
      "comment": "A single cry, or a sudden remark; also of a crowd applauding (Lewis &amp; Short)."
    },
    {
